{"path":"utility/variadic","title":"Variadic functions","titleHtml":"Variadic functions","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/variadic","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Variadic functions are functions (e.g. std::printf) which take a variable number of arguments.","html":"<p>Variadic functions are functions (e.g. <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/c/fprintf\">std::printf</a></span>) which take a <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/variadic_arguments\">variable number of arguments</a>.\n</p><p>To declare a variadic function, an ellipsis appears after the list of parameters, e.g. <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> printf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> format...<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>, which may be preceded by an optional comma. See <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/variadic_arguments\">Variadic arguments</a> for additional detail on the syntax, automatic argument conversions and the alternatives.\n</p><p>To access the variadic arguments from the function body, the following library facilities are provided:\n</p>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstdarg\">&lt;cstdarg&gt;</a></code> </div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_start</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  enables access to variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_arg</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  accesses the next variadic function argument <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_copy</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  makes a copy of the variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_end</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  ends traversal of the variadic function arguments <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function macro)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_list\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>va_list</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  holds the information needed by <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\">va_start</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\">va_arg</a></span>, <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\">va_end</a></span>, and <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_copy\">va_copy</a></span> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(typedef)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstdarg&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> simple_printf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> fmt...<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"co1\">// C-style \"const char* fmt, ...\" is also valid</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">va_list</span> args<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_start\"><span class=\"kw965\">va_start</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args, fmt<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">while</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fmt <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es5\">\\0</span>'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fmt <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"st0\">'d'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"><span class=\"kw967\">va_arg</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fmt <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"st0\">'c'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"co1\">// note automatic conversion to integral type</span>\n            <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> c <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"><span class=\"kw967\">va_arg</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"kw1\">static_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>c<span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">else</span> <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>fmt <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> <span class=\"st0\">'f'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n            <span class=\"kw4\">double</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_arg\"><span class=\"kw967\">va_arg</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args, <span class=\"kw4\">double</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> d <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n        <span class=\"sy2\">++</span>fmt<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/variadic/va_end\"><span class=\"kw968\">va_end</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>args<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    simple_printf<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"dcff\"</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"st0\">'a'</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">1.999</span>, <span class=\"nu16\">42.5</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> \n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>3\na\n1.999\n42.5</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/variadic\">C documentation</a></span> for <span><span>Variadic functions</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"}],"children":[{"path":"utility/variadic/va_arg","title":"va_arg"},{"path":"utility/variadic/va_copy","title":"va_copy"},{"path":"utility/variadic/va_end","title":"va_end"},{"path":"utility/variadic/va_list","title":"std::va_list"},{"path":"utility/variadic/va_start","title":"va_start"}],"map":{"label":"Variadic functions","children":[{"label":"Entries","children":[{"label":"va_start","note":"enables access to variadic function arguments"},{"label":"va_arg","note":"accesses the next variadic function argument"},{"label":"va_copy","note":"makes a copy of the variadic function arguments"},{"label":"va_end","note":"ends traversal of the variadic function arguments"},{"label":"va_list","note":"holds the information needed by va_start, va_arg, va_end, and va_copy"}]},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C++11"],"wordCount":234,"codeBlockCount":2}
